### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Check controller readiness, leader election and Collector scrape errors. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Controller restart, failed scheduling or a blocked scrape endpoint.

### Fix
Restore controller readiness and network access; inspect pending workflows for impact.

### Verify
The next observed scrape reports up=1 and workflow reconciliation resumes. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
